Vendored from the @codesweep-ai/ui design system.

  package:  @codesweep-ai/ui v1.12.0
  copied:   2026-08-16
  subset:   only what apps/viewer imports, plus the transitive closure —
            AppShell (Header, Footer), Card, CardGroupContext, CodeBlock,
            SearchInput, Skeleton, StatusBadge, ThemeToggle, lib/cn,
            lib/useTheme, lib/chartTheme, styles/tokens.css, styles/base.css

The upstream package is not published, so a clone of this repository could not
resolve it. Vendoring the subset is what makes `npm ci` and the viewer build
work in one directory, with no second checkout.

Re-vendoring: copy the files above from upstream, run `make viewer-build`, and
update the version and date here. Adding an export means vendoring that
component and everything it imports as well.
